{
    "title": "Highrise: Avatar, Chat & Games",
    "description": "Welcome to Highrise, your virtual home online where you can connect, play, and express your digital self with existing and soon-to-be friends in amazing shared experiences. Join a community of over 50 million people in a new world full of endless possibilities. Create your avatar, explore fashion, connect with friends, play together and build a world that is uniquely \"\"you\"\"!\r\n\r\n<b> CONNECT THROUGH PLAY </b>\r\n\r\n- Dive into a new online space with millions of users.\r\n- Play, create and design together with friends from around the world.\r\n- Join thousands of virtual rooms for games, fashion runways, talent shows, chats or casual hangouts.\r\n- Participate in weekly Events to play and earn new outfits for your avatar.\r\n- Relax in a safe and friendly environment, supported by our world-class team.\r\n\r\n<b> EXPRESS YOURSELF </b>\r\n\r\n- Create a unique virtual avatar that suits your true self.\r\n- Customize your profile with a background, bio, and showcase your favorite items.\r\n- Explore millions of fashion styles and get inspired by new dress up items.\r\n- Get creative and design items in community contests, brought to life by our talented artists.\r\n- Design virtual rooms for yourself and your friends to enjoy.\r\n\r\n<b> SOCIALIZE BEYOND LIMITS </b>\r\n\r\n- Use messages or voice chat to connect with friends in virtual worlds.\r\n- Share your experiences through text or media posts on the Feed.\r\n- Follow your friends, grow your community and become a trendsetter.\r\n- Express yourself via avatar emotes: wave, dance, sing, pose.\r\n\r\n<b> DESIGN & COLLECT </b>\r\n\r\n- Explore a collection of 50,000+ fashion and avatar customization items, with new collections added weekly.\r\n- Track the community-run marketplace to buy and sell your way to a better outfit and profit.\r\n- Every player is an opportunity, inspect their avatar's outfit and offer a trade via the Inbox.\r\n- Keep track of your favorite items by saving them to your personal Wishlist.\r\n- Use filters and categories to easily find exactly what you need.\r\n\r\nStart your Highrise journey, where you\u2019ll find genuine moments meet boundless creativity. Play, chat and create!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Highrise, your virtual home online where you can connect, play, and express your digital self with existing and soon-to-be friends in amazing shared experiences. Join a community of over 50 million people in a new world full of endless possibilities. Create your avatar, explore fashion, connect with friends, play together and build a world that is uniquely &quot;&quot;you&quot;&quot;!<br><br><b> CONNECT THROUGH PLAY </b><br><br>- Dive into a new online space with millions of users.<br>- Play, create and design together with friends from around the world.<br>- Join thousands of virtual rooms for games, fashion runways, talent shows, chats or casual hangouts.<br>- Participate in weekly Events to play and earn new outfits for your avatar.<br>- Relax in a safe and friendly environment, supported by our world-class team.<br><br><b> EXPRESS YOURSELF </b><br><br>- Create a unique virtual avatar that suits your true self.<br>- Customize your profile with a background, bio, and showcase your favorite items.<br>- Explore millions of fashion styles and get inspired by new dress up items.<br>- Get creative and design items in community contests, brought to life by our talented artists.<br>- Design virtual rooms for yourself and your friends to enjoy.<br><br><b> SOCIALIZE BEYOND LIMITS </b><br><br>- Use messages or voice chat to connect with friends in virtual worlds.<br>- Share your experiences through text or media posts on the Feed.<br>- Follow your friends, grow your community and become a trendsetter.<br>- Express yourself via avatar emotes: wave, dance, sing, pose.<br><br><b> DESIGN &amp; COLLECT </b><br><br>- Explore a collection of 50,000+ fashion and avatar customization items, with new collections added weekly.<br>- Track the community-run marketplace to buy and sell your way to a better outfit and profit.<br>- Every player is an opportunity, inspect their avatar&#39;s outfit and offer a trade via the Inbox.<br>- Keep track of your favorite items by saving them to your personal Wishlist.<br>- Use filters and categories to easily find exactly what you need.<br><br>Start your Highrise journey, where you\u2019ll find genuine moments meet boundless creativity. Play, chat and create!",
